sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as NestJS
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  C->>A: POST /api/v1/orders + bearer + Idempotency-Key
  A->>D: BEGIN SERIALIZABLE
  A->>D: Lock user/cart transaction
  A->>D: Lookup (userId, idempotencyKey)
  alt Same request already exists
    D-->>A: Original order snapshot
  else New request
    A->>D: Read owned address and cart/SKUs
    A->>A: Validate price confirmation and cart version
    A->>D: Conditional inventory decrement quantity >= requested
    alt Any item unavailable
      A->>D: ROLLBACK all items
      A-->>C: 409 STOCK_CHANGED
    else All available
      A->>D: Order + immutable item/address snapshots + pending COD
      A->>D: Inventory movements + clear ordered cart
      A->>D: COMMIT
    end
  end
  A-->>C: Persisted order (retries return same ID)
